# Cloudflare Pages Edge Routing Rules
# Proxy /api calls to Google Cloud Run container with zero CORS (200 = transparent proxy)
# When you have your Cloud Run URL, replace the destination below:
/api/*  https://geoportal-backend-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ID.a.run.app/api/:splat  200

# Single Page Application (SPA) fallback: all client routes load index.html
/*  /index.html  200
